1
00:01:31,760 --> 00:01:35,009
[In my prime]

2
00:01:35,340 --> 00:01:37,690
[Episode 23]

3
00:02:03,760 --> 00:02:04,420
I was wrong.

4
00:02:07,680 --> 00:02:08,080
Honey.

5
00:02:08,840 --> 00:02:09,229
Get up.

6
00:02:09,229 --> 00:02:09,800
Don't go.

7
00:02:10,360 --> 00:02:10,759
Honey,

8
00:02:11,310 --> 00:02:12,710
I really know I was wrong.

9
00:02:12,970 --> 00:02:14,370
Forgive me one last time.

10
00:02:15,080 --> 00:02:16,940
Let's just live a good life, okay?

11
00:02:17,030 --> 00:02:18,079
So many people are watching.

12
00:02:18,079 --> 00:02:18,810
Aren't you embarrassed?

13
00:02:18,810 --> 00:02:19,870
-No, I'm not.
-Go away!

14
00:02:19,870 --> 00:02:20,800
I'm not ashamed.

15
00:02:21,120 --> 00:02:23,320
It'd be embarrassing if my wife left me.

16
00:02:25,560 --> 00:02:26,690
Kneel if you want to.

17
00:02:27,660 --> 00:02:29,030
I'm not going home with you.

18
00:02:29,030 --> 00:02:30,430
I really know I was wrong.

19
00:02:30,750 --> 00:02:31,430
Forgive me.

20
00:02:32,560 --> 00:02:34,220
I should have listened to you.

21
00:02:34,590 --> 00:02:36,120
That blond guy is a scammer.

22
00:02:36,370 --> 00:02:37,190
He's hiding in Russia now

23
00:02:37,190 --> 00:02:38,190
and he doesn't dare come back.

24
00:02:38,190 --> 00:02:39,990
I have absolutely nothing left.

25
00:02:40,470 --> 00:02:41,590
If you and Doudou don't want me anymore,

26
00:02:41,590 --> 00:02:42,650
I might as well die.

27
00:02:42,680 --> 00:02:43,079
Honey.

28
00:02:43,430 --> 00:02:43,829
Honey.

29
00:02:43,960 --> 00:02:45,079
Si doesn't want to go home with you.

30
00:02:45,079 --> 00:02:46,340
Don't you understand?

31
00:02:48,840 --> 00:02:49,360
Cao Xin.

32
00:02:50,400 --> 00:02:51,870
Am I being too nice to you?

33
00:02:54,079 --> 00:02:55,310
I usually call you my brother-in-law.

34
00:02:55,310 --> 00:02:56,240
It's out of respect.

35
00:02:56,240 --> 00:02:57,170
I'm telling you,

36
00:02:57,590 --> 00:03:00,120
stay out of things
between your sister and me.

37
00:03:00,560 --> 00:03:01,420
Where's my son?

38
00:03:01,870 --> 00:03:02,870
Where did you hide him?

39
00:03:02,870 --> 00:03:04,670
So you do remember you have a son.

40
00:03:05,150 --> 00:03:06,590
Did you ever act like his father

41
00:03:06,590 --> 00:03:08,790
when you were doing those lousy things?

42
00:03:12,280 --> 00:03:12,710
Si.

43
00:03:12,910 --> 00:03:13,640
Zhou Xuanyu!

44
00:03:13,810 --> 00:03:14,540
Stop it.

45
00:03:14,560 --> 00:03:15,400
-Dad.
-Zhou Xuanyu, stop!

46
00:03:15,400 --> 00:03:15,840
Let me explain.

47
00:03:15,840 --> 00:03:16,570
-I...
-Stop!

48
00:03:16,840 --> 00:03:17,240
Honey.

49
00:03:17,280 --> 00:03:17,960
-Dad.
-Honey.

50
00:03:17,960 --> 00:03:18,310
Honey,

51
00:03:18,310 --> 00:03:18,750
let go!

52
00:03:19,470 --> 00:03:20,400
Why did you come?

53
00:03:23,190 --> 00:03:24,120
If I hadn't come,

54
00:03:25,000 --> 00:03:26,280
how long would you have kept this

55
00:03:26,280 --> 00:03:27,000
from me?

56
00:03:28,630 --> 00:03:29,560
Where's Doudou?

57
00:03:30,079 --> 00:03:31,410
What exactly happened?

58
00:03:31,710 --> 00:03:34,040
I'll explain everything when we get home.

59
00:03:35,240 --> 00:03:36,170
I didn't hit her.

60
00:03:36,560 --> 00:03:37,310
Zhou Xuanyu.

61
00:03:38,750 --> 00:03:40,880
When Si chose to forgive you last time,

62
00:03:41,190 --> 00:03:41,870
that was already your

63
00:03:41,870 --> 00:03:42,840
last chance.

64
00:03:43,840 --> 00:03:44,430
Our whole family

65
00:03:44,430 --> 00:03:45,829
respected her decision.

66
00:03:46,000 --> 00:03:46,400
So

67
00:03:47,400 --> 00:03:48,030
we didn't interfere with

68
00:03:48,030 --> 00:03:49,160
your relationship.

69
00:03:49,680 --> 00:03:51,740
But you kept doing it again and again.

70
00:03:52,280 --> 00:03:53,310
We can't keep showing you

71
00:03:53,310 --> 00:03:54,440
any consideration.

72
00:03:54,960 --> 00:03:55,490
About Si.

73
00:03:55,710 --> 00:03:57,170
I'm taking her home today!

74
00:03:57,400 --> 00:03:58,240
Si, let's go!

75
00:03:58,470 --> 00:03:58,800
Dad.

76
00:03:59,030 --> 00:03:59,430
Let go.

77
00:03:59,960 --> 00:04:00,400
Honey,

78
00:04:00,520 --> 00:04:01,280
I know I was wrong.

79
00:04:01,280 --> 00:04:03,080
Zhou Xuanyu, I'm divorcing you!

80
00:04:27,740 --> 00:04:31,230
[All the Rage]

81
00:04:32,800 --> 00:04:33,800
Three thousand?

82
00:04:35,560 --> 00:04:36,000
No.

83
00:04:36,000 --> 00:04:37,560
I can offer 1,500 at most

84
00:04:37,580 --> 00:04:38,580
plus commission.

85
00:04:38,830 --> 00:04:40,159
From 9 a.m. to midnight.

86
00:04:41,800 --> 00:04:43,400
You think that's too little?

87
00:04:43,510 --> 00:04:43,920
Wait.

88
00:04:44,870 --> 00:04:45,630
I mean,

89
00:04:45,630 --> 00:04:47,000
Our company is just getting started,

90
00:04:47,000 --> 00:04:47,630
so the pay

91
00:04:47,630 --> 00:04:49,290
probably won't be that great.

92
00:04:49,430 --> 00:04:50,480
But when we get more customers,

93
00:04:50,480 --> 00:04:51,810
it'll be more than that.

94
00:04:55,870 --> 00:04:56,240
Okay.

95
00:04:57,240 --> 00:04:59,240
Think about it then.

96
00:05:04,750 --> 00:05:05,750
Why is it so hard

97
00:05:05,750 --> 00:05:07,280
to hire someone these days?

98
00:05:09,720 --> 00:05:10,310
Qi Shi.

99
00:05:12,800 --> 00:05:14,060
Do you think I can do it?

100
00:05:17,680 --> 00:05:18,190
Look.

101
00:05:19,720 --> 00:05:20,480
And then.

102
00:05:22,350 --> 00:05:23,370
Click here...

103
00:05:33,240 --> 00:05:33,830
Right, right, right.

104
00:05:33,830 --> 00:05:34,360
This one?

105
00:05:34,560 --> 00:05:35,760
Right, right, right.

106
00:05:45,240 --> 00:05:46,580
Doudou, Doudou.

107
00:05:47,040 --> 00:05:47,950
Mommy's busy.

108
00:05:48,190 --> 00:05:50,190
Want Auntie to play with you
for a while?

109
00:05:50,190 --> 00:05:51,000
Really?

110
00:05:51,510 --> 00:05:52,360
Really.

111
00:05:52,830 --> 00:05:53,430
Come here,

112
00:05:53,760 --> 00:05:55,159
let Auntie give you a hug.

113
00:05:58,830 --> 00:05:59,690
What a good boy.

114
00:06:00,160 --> 00:06:02,510
Have you ever played
"Eagle Catches Chicks"?

115
00:06:02,510 --> 00:06:03,360
Never.

116
00:06:03,430 --> 00:06:04,120
Never?

117
00:06:04,120 --> 00:06:05,560
How about we play this?

118
00:06:06,070 --> 00:06:06,560
Okay.

119
00:06:08,000 --> 00:06:08,970
We've got a hen

120
00:06:09,000 --> 00:06:09,870
and a chick,

121
00:06:10,440 --> 00:06:11,390
but what about the eagle?

122
00:06:11,390 --> 00:06:12,600
Think of a way for me.

123
00:06:15,260 --> 00:06:16,090
Uncle!

124
00:06:18,390 --> 00:06:19,320
Perfect timing.

125
00:06:19,480 --> 00:06:20,480
Come play with us.

126
00:06:20,600 --> 00:06:21,530
You be the eagle.

127
00:06:28,390 --> 00:06:29,370
Don't let the eagle catch you.

128
00:06:29,370 --> 00:06:30,260
Run! Run! Run!

129
00:06:33,240 --> 00:06:34,310
Got you!

130
00:06:40,430 --> 00:06:41,310
You be the eagle, okay?

131
00:06:41,310 --> 00:06:41,830
No.

132
00:07:35,730 --> 00:07:38,850
[Aihua Steamed Bun Shop]

133
00:07:43,630 --> 00:07:44,000
Mom.

134
00:07:44,310 --> 00:07:45,240
Take a break. Rest for a bit.

135
00:07:45,240 --> 00:07:45,970
Look at this.

136
00:07:47,120 --> 00:07:47,850
What's this?

137
00:07:48,360 --> 00:07:49,020
Take a look.

138
00:07:51,170 --> 00:07:52,830
Why did you buy this?

139
00:07:54,070 --> 00:07:54,930
I didn't buy it.

140
00:07:55,070 --> 00:07:55,800
Cao Xin bought it

141
00:07:55,800 --> 00:07:56,310
for you.

142
00:07:57,560 --> 00:07:58,890
Cao Xin bought it for me?

143
00:08:01,040 --> 00:08:02,160
You didn't know?

144
00:08:02,730 --> 00:08:03,570
The kid

145
00:08:03,600 --> 00:08:05,040
just wants to spare us some effort

146
00:08:05,040 --> 00:08:06,240
when we hawk our buns.

147
00:08:10,040 --> 00:08:11,800
Citizens of Sarajevo!

148
00:08:12,510 --> 00:08:14,300
Citizens of Sarajevo!

149
00:08:14,360 --> 00:08:16,160
Come take a look!

150
00:08:17,740 --> 00:08:18,600
Big steamed buns,

151
00:08:18,600 --> 00:08:19,800
fresh and piping hot buns!

152
00:08:19,800 --> 00:08:20,480
Dad, Dad!

153
00:08:20,920 --> 00:08:23,070
This is way more advanced
than what you described.

154
00:08:23,070 --> 00:08:23,630
Cao Xin said

155
00:08:23,630 --> 00:08:24,800
he recorded it

156
00:08:24,830 --> 00:08:25,770
exactly the way you usually hawk.

157
00:08:25,770 --> 00:08:26,480
Just put this

158
00:08:26,480 --> 00:08:27,190
by the door,

159
00:08:27,310 --> 00:08:27,830
so you won't have to

160
00:08:27,830 --> 00:08:28,720
shout yourself hoarse.

161
00:08:28,720 --> 00:08:29,920
He recorded all of it?

162
00:08:29,950 --> 00:08:30,950
How do I use it?

163
00:08:31,270 --> 00:08:32,870
Look, there's a switch here.

164
00:08:33,510 --> 00:08:35,440
After you press it,
this indicator light comes on.

165
00:08:35,440 --> 00:08:36,000
And then?

166
00:08:36,030 --> 00:08:36,630
In a second.

167
00:08:36,630 --> 00:08:37,750
One bun fills you up.

168
00:08:37,750 --> 00:08:38,760
Two buns knock you out.

169
00:08:38,760 --> 00:08:40,390
One will leave you satisfied.

170
00:08:40,390 --> 00:08:42,360
Two will bring you pure joy.

171
00:08:42,510 --> 00:08:44,169
Do I usually hawk my buns like that?

172
00:08:44,169 --> 00:08:45,080
Quick, turn it off.

173
00:08:45,080 --> 00:08:45,840
Turn it off.

174
00:08:46,750 --> 00:08:47,880
This is pretty good.

175
00:08:48,320 --> 00:08:49,480
Is this really how

176
00:08:49,510 --> 00:08:50,910
the kids see me?

177
00:08:54,320 --> 00:08:56,120
What are you nodding for?

178
00:08:56,320 --> 00:08:57,720
I'm watching TV.

179
00:08:57,750 --> 00:08:58,750
Stop watching TV.

180
00:08:58,840 --> 00:09:00,700
It's mealtime. Hurry up and cook!

181
00:09:01,480 --> 00:09:01,940
This...

182
00:09:02,960 --> 00:09:03,690
This thing

183
00:09:03,720 --> 00:09:05,120
is actually quite fancy.

184
00:09:05,260 --> 00:09:06,360
One bun fills you up.

185
00:09:06,360 --> 00:09:07,550
Two buns knock you out.

186
00:09:07,550 --> 00:09:08,870
One will leave you satisfied.

187
00:09:08,870 --> 00:09:10,910
Two will bring you pure joy.

188
00:09:12,010 --> 00:09:13,210
One bun fills you up.

189
00:09:13,240 --> 00:09:14,390
Two buns knock you out.

190
00:09:14,390 --> 00:09:15,840
One will leave you satisfied.

191
00:09:15,840 --> 00:09:17,870
Two will bring you pure joy.

192
00:09:18,960 --> 00:09:20,080
One bun fills you up.

193
00:09:20,080 --> 00:09:21,270
Two buns knock you out.

194
00:09:21,270 --> 00:09:22,720
One will leave you satisfied.

195
00:09:22,720 --> 00:09:24,720
Two will bring you pure joy.

196
00:09:30,000 --> 00:09:31,200
I brought your stuff.

197
00:09:41,320 --> 00:09:42,930
Our company just held

198
00:09:42,960 --> 00:09:44,160
a new product launch,

199
00:09:44,360 --> 00:09:46,160
and you already got the catalog.

200
00:09:46,720 --> 00:09:47,570
So what?

201
00:09:51,320 --> 00:09:52,920
What are you tinkering with?

202
00:09:53,550 --> 00:09:55,480
Trade secret. I'm not telling you.

203
00:09:56,510 --> 00:09:57,630
A little five-star shop

204
00:09:57,630 --> 00:09:58,720
has trade secrets?

205
00:09:59,440 --> 00:10:01,010
What's wrong with my five-star shop?

206
00:10:01,010 --> 00:10:01,670
Every Crown-rated shop

207
00:10:01,670 --> 00:10:02,550
started

208
00:10:02,600 --> 00:10:03,730
as a five-star shop.

209
00:10:05,270 --> 00:10:07,910
You are preparing for
the Double 11 Shopping Festival?

210
00:10:07,910 --> 00:10:08,840
What a nuisance.

211
00:10:09,080 --> 00:10:09,840
Such a big secret,

212
00:10:09,840 --> 00:10:11,030
and you still guessed it.

213
00:10:11,030 --> 00:10:12,360
That's your big secret?

214
00:10:12,960 --> 00:10:15,290
That website approached our company too.

215
00:10:15,600 --> 00:10:17,030
I've already looked into

216
00:10:17,240 --> 00:10:18,150
their entire merchant promotion plan

217
00:10:18,150 --> 00:10:19,150
for the festival.

218
00:10:21,320 --> 00:10:22,550
What did you find?

219
00:10:23,870 --> 00:10:24,690
I heard

220
00:10:24,720 --> 00:10:25,680
that

221
00:10:25,720 --> 00:10:27,790
merchants taking part in the festival

222
00:10:27,790 --> 00:10:29,790
have to pay a 100,000-yuan deposit.

223
00:10:30,000 --> 00:10:31,960
You run a five-star shop,

224
00:10:32,320 --> 00:10:34,850
and you can't afford
a 100,000-yuan deposit?

225
00:10:34,910 --> 00:10:36,390
I can afford it.

226
00:10:37,600 --> 00:10:39,200
The problem is, once I pay it,

227
00:10:39,720 --> 00:10:42,080
I won't have enough cash flow
to pay for the goods.

228
00:10:42,080 --> 00:10:42,960
Mr. Lin

229
00:10:43,440 --> 00:10:44,440
is expecting payment soon.

230
00:10:44,440 --> 00:10:45,840
He keeps pressuring me.

231
00:10:46,300 --> 00:10:46,970
Si has taken

232
00:10:47,000 --> 00:10:48,320
several calls for me.

233
00:10:48,630 --> 00:10:49,760
If I don't settle up,

234
00:10:50,390 --> 00:10:52,360
my supply could be cut off.

235
00:10:52,750 --> 00:10:53,550
Which Mr. Lin?

236
00:10:54,960 --> 00:10:56,760
The one from Shenguang Chunxiu?

237
00:10:57,630 --> 00:10:59,090
I've always sourced my goods
from him.

238
00:10:59,090 --> 00:11:00,240
You can't delay paying him.

239
00:11:00,240 --> 00:11:01,300
Pay him right away.

240
00:11:01,670 --> 00:11:03,070
He's a seasoned operator

241
00:11:03,320 --> 00:11:04,150
and he plays dirty.

242
00:11:04,150 --> 00:11:05,810
You can't afford to cross him.

243
00:11:06,720 --> 00:11:08,750
Then what about the shopping festival?

244
00:11:08,750 --> 00:11:10,480
It's such a great opportunity.

245
00:11:11,290 --> 00:11:11,840
In the past,

246
00:11:11,840 --> 00:11:14,080
promotions were only
for traditional festivals.

247
00:11:14,080 --> 00:11:14,930
I've never heard of

248
00:11:14,930 --> 00:11:16,530
a promotion on Singles' Day.

249
00:11:17,630 --> 00:11:18,420
I think

250
00:11:18,720 --> 00:11:20,880
we should wait and see

251
00:11:20,910 --> 00:11:22,170
how the festival goes.

252
00:11:22,200 --> 00:11:24,130
Your shop has just gotten on track.

253
00:11:24,390 --> 00:11:25,790
Stability matters most.

254
00:11:25,970 --> 00:11:27,000
Why not wait and see

255
00:11:27,000 --> 00:11:28,290
how this year's festival goes?

256
00:11:28,290 --> 00:11:28,840
If it's good,

257
00:11:28,840 --> 00:11:30,500
you can always join next year.

258
00:11:33,910 --> 00:11:35,240
Are you participating?

259
00:11:35,330 --> 00:11:36,320
The senior managers

260
00:11:36,320 --> 00:11:37,510
are still discussing it.

261
00:11:37,510 --> 00:11:38,370
So I'm not sure.

262
00:11:42,790 --> 00:11:44,120
You don't think

263
00:11:44,620 --> 00:11:45,840
I'm advising you against it

264
00:11:45,840 --> 00:11:46,460
just to eliminate

265
00:11:46,460 --> 00:11:48,190
a competitor for Bolly, do you?

266
00:11:50,000 --> 00:11:51,870
Don't flatter yourself.

267
00:11:52,330 --> 00:11:52,970
Even if

268
00:11:53,000 --> 00:11:54,480
you become a super diamond shop,

269
00:11:54,480 --> 00:11:55,810
you'll only get a little

270
00:11:56,080 --> 00:11:56,960
small dividends behind

271
00:11:56,960 --> 00:11:58,240
those Hong Kong and Taiwan trends.

272
00:11:58,240 --> 00:11:58,960
A brand like Bolly

273
00:11:58,960 --> 00:12:00,050
wouldn't even give you

274
00:12:00,050 --> 00:12:01,340
a second glance.

275
00:12:03,080 --> 00:12:04,610
Why are you acting so cocky?

276
00:12:04,920 --> 00:12:05,630
I'm telling you,

277
00:12:05,630 --> 00:12:07,230
I can do original brands too.

278
00:12:07,550 --> 00:12:08,630
I'll attend

279
00:12:08,630 --> 00:12:10,490
the Double 11 Shopping Festival.

280
00:12:10,790 --> 00:12:11,390
Just wait.

281
00:12:11,660 --> 00:12:13,000
Wait until the day I make it big.

282
00:12:13,000 --> 00:12:14,670
I-I-I...

283
00:12:15,030 --> 00:12:16,230
Then what will you do?

284
00:12:17,310 --> 00:12:18,840
I'll hire you as my assistant.

285
00:12:18,840 --> 00:12:19,170
Deal.

286
00:12:19,660 --> 00:12:20,480
If you can prove

287
00:12:20,480 --> 00:12:21,000
you have

288
00:12:21,030 --> 00:12:23,670
what it takes to build
an original women's clothing brand,

289
00:12:23,670 --> 00:12:24,450
I'll quit my job

290
00:12:24,450 --> 00:12:25,450
and come help you.

291
00:12:27,150 --> 00:12:27,810
It's a deal.

292
00:12:28,440 --> 00:12:29,100
It's a deal.

293
00:12:30,960 --> 00:12:32,210
I've got plenty of experience

294
00:12:32,210 --> 00:12:33,760
