587
00:27:57,200 --> 00:27:58,440
people went online shopping,

588
00:27:58,440 --> 00:27:59,480
which became a way to celebrate

589
00:27:59,480 --> 00:28:00,350
Singles' Day,

590
00:28:00,720 --> 00:28:01,920
and eventually led to

591
00:28:01,920 --> 00:28:03,200
the Double 11 Shopping Festival.

592
00:28:03,200 --> 00:28:05,330
With the platform's coordination...

593
00:28:05,550 --> 00:28:06,110
And this.

594
00:28:07,070 --> 00:28:08,160
We can put some here.

595
00:28:08,160 --> 00:28:08,830
Is that all?

596
00:28:09,130 --> 00:28:09,680
There's more. There's more.

597
00:28:09,680 --> 00:28:11,010
That's all. That's all.

598
00:28:11,160 --> 00:28:12,590
The rest are just

599
00:28:12,920 --> 00:28:14,400
customer service inquiries.

600
00:28:14,400 --> 00:28:15,460
I can handle those.

601
00:28:16,790 --> 00:28:17,750
Si, Si.

602
00:28:17,920 --> 00:28:18,720
You should head home.

603
00:28:18,720 --> 00:28:19,610
You've been too busy these two days

604
00:28:19,610 --> 00:28:21,070
to spend time with Doudou.

605
00:28:21,070 --> 00:28:21,670
It's fine.

606
00:28:21,750 --> 00:28:23,410
I'll leave once I finish this.

607
00:28:27,820 --> 00:28:28,500
Perfect.

608
00:28:29,440 --> 00:28:31,840
I'll drop you off on my way
to deliver goods.

609
00:28:36,240 --> 00:28:37,170
Be careful, Sis.

610
00:28:37,960 --> 00:28:38,820
We're leaving.

611
00:28:39,240 --> 00:28:40,640
You guys get some rest early too.

612
00:28:40,640 --> 00:28:41,000
Okay.

613
00:28:42,440 --> 00:28:43,500
Careful, careful.

614
00:28:51,000 --> 00:28:52,260
You even brought wine?

615
00:28:52,790 --> 00:28:54,320
To celebrate your success.

616
00:28:55,350 --> 00:28:56,350
Celebrate?

617
00:28:57,550 --> 00:28:58,010
Tell me,

618
00:28:58,590 --> 00:28:59,750
what if

619
00:29:00,000 --> 00:29:01,310
