624
00:29:10,960 --> 00:29:12,020
Then what is it for?

625
00:29:13,270 --> 00:29:14,480
For

626
00:29:14,920 --> 00:29:16,250
the people taking part.

627
00:29:22,790 --> 00:29:23,850
Congratulations.

628
00:29:24,440 --> 00:29:25,770
You bet right this time.

629
00:29:27,650 --> 00:29:28,610
I don't lose.

630
00:29:30,680 --> 00:29:32,250
What are your plans

631
00:29:31,580 --> 00:29:35,530
♪ The wind blew through our hair ♪

632
00:29:32,400 --> 00:29:33,860
for this first pot of gold?

633
00:29:36,000 --> 00:29:36,920
I told you.

634
00:29:38,160 --> 00:29:38,920
Create original designs

635
00:29:38,220 --> 00:29:41,900
♪ The story slowly gets complicated too ♪

636
00:29:40,070 --> 00:29:41,070
and build a brand.

637
00:29:42,590 --> 00:29:43,320
Tell me more.

638
00:29:44,890 --> 00:29:49,890
♪ We never became anyone's myth ♪

639
00:29:48,720 --> 00:29:49,310
Before,

640
00:29:49,880 --> 00:29:51,110
when I had a street stall and a shop,

641
00:29:50,820 --> 00:29:55,900
♪ We only learned to grow up in the rain ♪

642
00:29:51,960 --> 00:29:53,350
I just sold

643
00:29:53,440 --> 00:29:54,700
whatever was popular.

644
00:29:55,720 --> 00:29:56,510
Those goods

645
00:29:57,160 --> 00:29:58,510
were all just copies of one another,

646
00:29:58,510 --> 00:29:59,110
with everyone copying everyone else.

647
00:29:58,550 --> 00:30:02,150
♪ Should we blame fate? ♪

648
00:29:59,790 --> 00:30:01,550
Small shops copied big ones,

649
00:30:01,880 --> 00:30:03,640
and domestic brands copied foreign ones.

650
00:30:03,640 --> 00:30:05,030
All I earned was

651
00:30:04,650 --> 00:30:08,700
♪ Adulthood is bandaging your own falls ♪

652
00:30:05,350 --> 00:30:06,590
the resale markup.

653
00:30:07,370 --> 00:30:08,850
Sure, they sell fast,

654
00:30:08,880 --> 00:30:10,340
but it's all about volume.

655
00:30:10,510 --> 00:30:11,750
They don't represent any real innovation.

656
00:30:11,310 --> 00:30:14,350
♪ Rented rooms, the last bus home ♪

657
00:30:13,750 --> 00:30:15,510
Only by doing original designs

658
00:30:14,370 --> 00:30:16,600
♪ What does the future hold? ♪

659
00:30:15,510 --> 00:30:16,640
and building a brand

660
00:30:16,880 --> 00:30:18,080
can I control these products

661
00:30:17,230 --> 00:30:21,890
♪ It's been long since I last had
the guts to say I feared ♪

662
00:30:18,110 --> 00:30:19,350
from the source.

663
00:30:20,220 --> 00:30:21,160
Then I can make money

664
00:30:21,160 --> 00:30:22,920
from more than just the products.

665
00:30:22,920 --> 00:30:23,880
I can make money

666
00:30:23,960 --> 00:30:25,380
from the entire industry chain.

667
00:30:25,380 --> 00:30:28,760
♪ Though we have nothing,
we still bustle about ♪

668
00:30:25,510 --> 00:30:26,310
You're right.

669
00:30:27,350 --> 00:30:29,270
But isn't it too fast

670
00:30:29,400 --> 00:30:31,460
to jump straight into building a brand?

671
00:30:31,460 --> 00:30:35,760
♪ Because the answer is clear
as long as you are around ♪

672
00:30:32,240 --> 00:30:33,370
Have you considered

673
00:30:33,680 --> 00:30:35,640
becoming a distributor for a major brand

674
00:30:35,640 --> 00:30:37,440
and building experience first?

675
00:30:37,850 --> 00:30:39,950
♪ The old dreams are now covered in dust ♪

676
00:30:39,920 --> 00:30:41,030
Ever heard of 'time waits for no one'?

677
00:30:39,970 --> 00:30:42,430
♪ But it's okay ♪

678
00:30:42,750 --> 00:30:43,590
Before today,

679
00:30:44,720 --> 00:30:45,480
not everyone

680
00:30:45,110 --> 00:30:50,190
♪ The morning glow will finally appear ♪

681
00:30:45,510 --> 00:30:47,570
believed in this shopping festival.

682
00:30:50,240 --> 00:30:50,960
But time

683
00:30:52,270 --> 00:30:53,200
waits for no one.

684
00:30:54,030 --> 00:30:54,440
I...

685
00:30:55,310 --> 00:30:57,040
never wait for opportunities.

686
00:31:02,350 --> 00:31:04,080
Let me tell you something else.

687
00:31:05,200 --> 00:31:09,450
♪ Who hasn't panicked
in this fast-paced world? ♪

688
00:31:05,240 --> 00:31:06,810
I officially

689
00:31:07,240 --> 00:31:08,790
resigned from Boli today.

690
00:31:10,160 --> 00:31:11,130
Now I'm a talent

691
00:31:11,160 --> 00:31:12,960
