692
00:31:11,880 --> 00:31:17,950
♪ All I see is your gaze ♪

693
00:31:14,350 --> 00:31:15,440
I wonder if your company

694
00:31:15,440 --> 00:31:17,270
has any hiring plans recently.

695
00:31:18,610 --> 00:31:23,200
♪ If there's nothing left tomorrow ♪

696
00:31:25,310 --> 00:31:35,330
♪ I'll still walk you home ♪

697
00:31:35,440 --> 00:31:37,440
[In my prime]

698
00:31:37,470 --> 00:31:38,400
Hello, Mr. Wang.

699
00:31:38,910 --> 00:31:39,840
This is Zhang Li.

700
00:31:40,890 --> 00:31:42,350
Zhang Li. How could you not recognize me?

701
00:31:42,350 --> 00:31:43,240
Chubby girl.

702
00:31:44,830 --> 00:31:46,360
Now you remember me, right?

703
00:31:47,070 --> 00:31:47,830
Here's the thing.

704
00:31:47,830 --> 00:31:48,270
I'm currently

705
00:31:48,270 --> 00:31:49,240
working at

706
00:31:49,240 --> 00:31:50,530
a friend's clothing company.

707
00:31:50,530 --> 00:31:51,560
We're an original

708
00:31:51,590 --> 00:31:52,690
women's clothing brand.

709
00:31:52,690 --> 00:31:53,480
I'd like to ask

710
00:31:53,480 --> 00:31:55,140
if you're free this afternoon

711
00:31:55,480 --> 00:31:56,210
to have a meal

712
00:31:56,350 --> 00:31:58,080
and discuss working together.

713
00:31:58,960 --> 00:32:00,110
Okay. Great.

714
00:32:00,590 --> 00:32:01,160
I'll book a table.

715
00:32:01,160 --> 00:32:02,260
We agreed on the shipping time.

716
00:32:02,260 --> 00:32:03,960
How can I move it up?

717
00:32:05,200 --> 00:32:06,350
That was so rude.

718
00:32:12,880 --> 00:32:13,650
Hello, Mr. Liu.

719
00:32:13,650 --> 00:32:14,580
This is Zhang Li.

720
00:32:15,030 --> 00:32:16,680
I checked our shipping order,

721
00:32:16,680 --> 00:32:18,680
and the date hasn't changed, right?

722
00:32:19,530 --> 00:32:20,830
Okay. Great.

723
00:32:21,010 --> 00:32:22,270
If the date hasn't changed,

724
00:32:22,270 --> 00:32:23,680
I'll call a truck and ship it right away.

725
00:32:23,680 --> 00:32:24,110
Qi Shi.

726
00:32:24,270 --> 00:32:24,590
Zhi.

727
00:32:24,640 --> 00:32:25,960
Today's shipment is ready.

728
00:32:25,960 --> 00:32:27,270
Thanks for your hard work, Zhi.

729
00:32:27,270 --> 00:32:27,730
I'm off.

730
00:32:28,110 --> 00:32:28,710
Good work.

731
00:32:31,350 --> 00:32:32,210
How's it going?

732
00:32:32,430 --> 00:32:34,110
Joining our startup
for your first venture,

733
00:32:34,110 --> 00:32:36,240
don't you feel like you hit the jackpot?

734
00:32:36,240 --> 00:32:37,040
Yes, yes, yes.

735
00:32:37,610 --> 00:32:38,550
But I still feel like

736
00:32:38,550 --> 00:32:39,810
something's missing.

737
00:32:40,200 --> 00:32:41,400
I know what you're thinking.

738
00:32:41,400 --> 00:32:43,160
The secret weapon is almost here.

739
00:32:43,160 --> 00:32:43,590
Qi Shi.

740
00:32:44,640 --> 00:32:45,640
I'm not late, am I?

741
00:32:46,030 --> 00:32:46,830
Not at all.

742
00:32:48,030 --> 00:32:49,630
Thanks for coming to help me.

743
00:32:50,200 --> 00:32:50,860
Have a seat.

744
00:32:50,880 --> 00:32:51,340
Come on.

745
00:32:52,110 --> 00:32:52,400
Right.

746
00:32:52,400 --> 00:32:53,600
Let me introduce you.

747
00:32:53,720 --> 00:32:54,110
Si.

748
00:32:54,400 --> 00:32:54,790
Okay.

749
00:32:57,510 --> 00:32:59,270
This is Zeng Yuanyuan.

750
00:32:59,750 --> 00:33:01,170
She's the first friend

751
00:33:01,200 --> 00:33:02,200
I made in Haizhou.

752
00:33:02,350 --> 00:33:03,750
You could call her my lucky break.

753
00:33:03,750 --> 00:33:05,750
Her creativity
and eye for style are unmatched.

754
00:33:05,750 --> 00:33:07,440
At my earnest invitation,

755
00:33:07,680 --> 00:33:09,870
she has joined In my prime

756
00:33:09,920 --> 00:33:11,960
as our creative director
and pattern maker.

757
00:33:11,960 --> 00:33:12,960
Welcome!

758
00:33:13,240 --> 00:33:14,300
Welcome, welcome!

759
00:33:15,920 --> 00:33:16,550
Next,

760
00:33:20,480 --> 00:33:22,140
I was thinking this year we...

761
00:33:22,350 --> 00:33:22,970
Boss Qi,

762
00:33:23,000 --> 00:33:24,350
how about we save the speech for later

763
00:33:24,350 --> 00:33:25,440
and get to work first?

764
00:33:25,440 --> 00:33:26,230
I know.

765
00:33:26,750 --> 00:33:28,150
Right. Work comes first.

766
00:33:28,960 --> 00:33:31,160
Why don't you show me around the office?

767
00:33:31,220 --> 00:33:32,750
Sure. I'll show you around.

768
00:33:32,790 --> 00:33:33,880
I need to take a call.

769
00:33:33,880 --> 00:33:35,140
Okay. I'll get to work.

770
00:33:35,350 --> 00:33:36,030
Mr. Liu.

771
00:33:45,590 --> 00:33:47,320
I've known since she was little

772
00:33:47,510 --> 00:33:48,550
that our girl

773
00:33:48,680 --> 00:33:50,590
would grow up to do great things.

774
00:33:53,000 --> 00:33:53,930
Do great things?

775
00:33:54,680 --> 00:33:56,000
She stays in that warehouse all day

776
00:33:56,000 --> 00:33:57,550
and never comes home.

777
00:34:00,550 --> 00:34:02,150
Her birthday's in a few days.

778
00:34:02,520 --> 00:34:03,680
Why don't we ask her over

779
00:34:03,680 --> 00:34:04,550
for dinner?

780
00:34:08,489 --> 00:34:09,679
Ask Cao Xin too,

781
00:34:09,710 --> 00:34:10,670
and see if he's free

782
00:34:10,670 --> 00:34:11,600
to come with her.

783
00:34:18,670 --> 00:34:19,600
Why are those two

784
00:34:19,670 --> 00:34:21,480
getting so close?

785
00:34:22,360 --> 00:34:23,960
They spend all day together,

786
00:34:25,400 --> 00:34:27,330
and I think something will happen.

787
00:34:28,510 --> 00:34:28,960
Honey.

788
00:34:30,590 --> 00:34:31,920
Before, it wasn't proper for our son

789
00:34:31,920 --> 00:34:33,150
to be with her.

790
00:34:34,350 --> 00:34:36,250
But now Cao Si is divorced

791
00:34:36,630 --> 00:34:37,630
and single.

792
00:34:38,280 --> 00:34:39,880
I don't think it's a bad thing

793
00:34:40,110 --> 00:34:41,310
if they get together.

794
00:34:43,320 --> 00:34:44,250
What did you say?

795
00:34:46,800 --> 00:34:48,190
We can't really do anything about

796
00:34:48,190 --> 00:34:49,989
the kids' affairs.

797
00:34:55,280 --> 00:34:56,739
Cao Xin's all grown up too.

798
00:34:56,900 --> 00:34:57,440
I wonder

799
00:34:57,440 --> 00:34:58,700
if he has a girlfriend.

800
00:35:02,960 --> 00:35:05,070
Why do you think Cao Xin and Qi Shi

801
00:35:05,070 --> 00:35:06,550
are so close?

802
00:35:07,070 --> 00:35:09,230
He gave up a cushy white-collar job

803
00:35:09,680 --> 00:35:10,850
to start a business

804
00:35:10,880 --> 00:35:11,940
with our daughter.

805
00:35:12,590 --> 00:35:14,520
Could something have happened...

806
00:35:14,550 --> 00:35:16,190
between them?

807
00:35:18,670 --> 00:35:19,400
I doubt it.

808
00:35:20,480 --> 00:35:21,550
Those two fight

809
00:35:21,550 --> 00:35:23,070
like cats and dogs every day.

810
00:35:23,070 --> 00:35:23,800
Impossible.

811
00:35:26,200 --> 00:35:26,860
If we base it

812
00:35:26,880 --> 00:35:28,290
on the previous prices,

813
00:35:28,320 --> 00:35:29,510
it'll be hard to turn a profit

814
00:35:29,510 --> 00:35:30,710
on original designs.

815
00:35:30,710 --> 00:35:31,240
You know?

816
00:35:31,480 --> 00:35:32,590
That's why I said we should pair them

817
00:35:32,590 --> 00:35:33,920
with some low-priced items.

818
00:35:33,920 --> 00:35:35,000
You still need to soften the price shock

819
00:35:35,000 --> 00:35:35,760
of original items

820
00:35:35,760 --> 00:35:36,920
for customers!

821
00:35:36,940 --> 00:35:38,230
Then the style of your whole store

822
00:35:38,230 --> 00:35:39,490
will be inconsistent.

823
00:35:39,510 --> 00:35:41,190
It'll be hard to make the store memorable.

824
00:35:41,190 --> 00:35:41,880
In the end,

825
00:35:41,880 --> 00:35:42,800
you'll please no one.

826
00:35:42,800 --> 00:35:43,960
What do you mean, inconsistent?

827
00:35:43,960 --> 00:35:45,510
Why can't I make you understand?

828
00:35:45,510 --> 00:35:46,880
Haven't I made myself clear?

829
00:35:46,880 --> 00:35:47,440
I'm done talking to you.

830
00:35:47,440 --> 00:35:47,920
Pull over!

831
00:35:47,920 --> 00:35:48,840
I'm driving on the road right now.

832
00:35:48,840 --> 00:35:49,150
How am I supposed to stop?

833
00:35:49,150 --> 00:35:50,320
I don't want to be
in the same car with you anymore.

834
00:35:50,320 --> 00:35:51,090
I don't want to breathe
the same air as you.

835
00:35:51,090 --> 00:35:51,820
Pull over!

836
00:36:00,880 --> 00:36:02,190
I'm talking to you!

837
00:36:02,480 --> 00:36:03,250
My customers

838
00:36:03,280 --> 00:36:04,680
used to be poor students.

839
00:36:04,890 --> 00:36:05,630
You can't expect them

840
00:36:05,630 --> 00:36:07,030
to accept the prices

841
00:36:07,050 --> 00:36:08,630
of original items right away!

842
00:36:08,630 --> 00:36:09,230
Bro,

843
00:36:09,590 --> 00:36:11,440
what's wrong with offering a discount,

844
00:36:11,440 --> 00:36:13,170
running promotions, or giving out coupons?

845
00:36:13,170 --> 00:36:14,280
You need to retain customers

846
00:36:14,280 --> 00:36:15,640
for long-term growth.

847
00:36:17,320 --> 00:36:18,120
Cao Xin.

848
00:36:18,710 --> 00:36:19,970
I know you're in there.

849
00:36:20,330 --> 00:36:20,770
And

850
00:36:20,800 --> 00:36:22,230
these traditional paper boxes

851
00:36:22,230 --> 00:36:23,670
can all be replaced
with plastic packaging.

852
00:36:23,670 --> 00:36:25,440
It saves 30 cents per order.

853
00:36:25,460 --> 00:36:26,880
It's durable and cost-effective.

854
00:36:26,880 --> 00:36:28,010
Why not switch them?

855
00:36:28,030 --> 00:36:29,320
The customer in internet is

856
00:36:29,320 --> 00:36:30,840
our biggest customer base.

857
00:36:30,840 --> 00:36:32,000
That's why the box matters.

858
00:36:32,000 --> 00:36:33,110
It's the first impression.

859
00:36:33,110 --> 00:36:34,130
It's very important.

860
00:36:34,130 --> 00:36:35,150
You didn't issue 50-yuan coupons,

861
00:36:35,150 --> 00:36:36,190
and I let that slide,

862
00:36:36,190 --> 00:36:37,190
but why are you haggling over

863
00:36:37,190 --> 00:36:38,000
30 cents now?

864
00:36:38,150 --> 00:36:39,880
Our company is just starting out!

865
00:36:39,880 --> 00:36:41,550
We must strictly control costs.

866
00:36:41,550 --> 00:36:42,950
Every little bit adds up!

867
00:36:43,070 --> 00:36:43,880
Change them all.

868
00:36:43,880 --> 00:36:44,680
Put that down!

869
00:36:45,000 --> 00:36:45,920
Tell me,

870
00:36:45,920 --> 00:36:47,400
which is more important,
30 cents or brand image?

871
00:36:47,400 --> 00:36:48,190
Thirty cents, of course.

872
00:36:48,190 --> 00:36:49,190
Stop, stop, stop.

873
00:36:50,760 --> 00:36:51,800
Stop arguing, you two.

874
00:36:51,800 --> 00:36:53,260
Did you forget something?

875
00:36:53,610 --> 00:36:54,760
The logistics bill is paid.

876
00:36:54,760 --> 00:36:56,020
Salaries are paid too.

877
00:36:56,030 --> 00:36:57,840
Next quarter's samples have been sent out.

878
00:36:57,840 --> 00:36:59,500
I paid the deposit last month.

879
00:37:00,000 --> 00:37:00,360
No,

880
00:37:00,360 --> 00:37:02,550
why are you two thinking only about work?

881
00:37:02,550 --> 00:37:04,110
It's your birthdays today.

882
00:37:10,360 --> 00:37:11,110
Aihua, come here.

883
00:37:11,110 --> 00:37:12,710
Help me lift this tablecloth.

884
00:37:12,710 --> 00:37:13,070
Okay.

885
00:37:13,480 --> 00:37:13,940
Come on.

886
00:37:14,760 --> 00:37:15,220
Come on.

887
00:37:16,480 --> 00:37:18,710
I asked you to come home for dinner,

888
00:37:19,000 --> 00:37:20,110
but I had to come all the way here

889
00:37:20,110 --> 00:37:21,710
to celebrate your birthday.

890
00:37:22,230 --> 00:37:23,440
I forgot, Mom.

891
00:37:23,810 --> 00:37:24,890
Thanks, Mom,

892
00:37:24,920 --> 00:37:26,590
for making all this delicious food.

893
00:37:26,590 --> 00:37:27,590
There's cake too.

894
00:37:27,760 --> 00:37:28,630
There's cake?

895
00:37:31,550 --> 00:37:32,470
I picked this cake

896
00:37:32,470 --> 00:37:33,400
out myself.

897
00:37:33,630 --> 00:37:34,290
Take a look.

898
00:37:35,040 --> 00:37:35,480
Doesn't it

899
00:37:35,480 --> 00:37:36,880
taste better than Cao's?

900
00:37:37,590 --> 00:37:38,110
I don't like hearing

901
00:37:38,110 --> 00:37:38,960
you say that.

902
00:37:39,190 --> 00:37:40,000
I had this

903
00:37:40,030 --> 00:37:41,830
custom-made at a special place.

904
00:37:42,040 --> 00:37:42,800
Custom-made,

905
00:37:42,800 --> 00:37:43,800
and it's so small?

906
00:37:45,050 --> 00:37:45,680
Tonight

907
00:37:45,710 --> 00:37:47,040
will be a fierce battle.

908
00:37:48,230 --> 00:37:48,830
Stay calm.

909
00:37:49,150 --> 00:37:49,710
Hold on.

910
00:37:50,930 --> 00:37:51,550
What is this?

911
00:37:51,550 --> 00:37:53,150
Look at mine. Isn't it grand?

912
00:37:54,150 --> 00:37:55,590
You two old men

913
00:37:55,590 --> 00:37:57,320
are actually fighting over cakes.

914
00:37:57,320 --> 00:37:58,440
You should ask the kids

915
00:37:58,440 --> 00:37:59,700
which one they prefer.

916
00:37:59,840 --> 00:38:01,170
Which one do you prefer?

917
00:38:05,440 --> 00:38:06,550
Well, we...

918
00:38:07,150 --> 00:38:08,630
-How about…
-Let's eat both.

919
00:38:08,630 --> 00:38:09,360
T-Together.

920
00:38:09,510 --> 00:38:09,910
Right.

921
00:38:10,360 --> 00:38:11,890
That way, you offend no one.

922
00:38:12,320 --> 00:38:15,360
♪ Happy birthday to you ♪

923
00:38:15,960 --> 00:38:18,840
♪ Happy birthday to you ♪

924
00:38:19,310 --> 00:38:22,700
♪ Happy birthday to you ♪

925
00:38:23,280 --> 00:38:26,920
♪ Happy birthday to you ♪

926
00:38:27,280 --> 00:38:27,680
Great.

927
00:38:28,410 --> 00:38:29,610
Blow out the candles.

928
00:38:30,760 --> 00:38:31,150
Okay.

929
00:38:32,230 --> 00:38:33,190
-Thank you, mom.
- Be happy.

930
00:38:33,190 --> 00:38:34,070
Give me a hug.

931
00:38:34,070 --> 00:38:35,360
Happy birthday, sweetie.

932
00:38:35,360 --> 00:38:36,290
Happy birthday.

933
00:38:37,560 --> 00:38:38,930
Happy birthday, Son.

934
00:38:38,960 --> 00:38:39,690
Thanks, Dad.

935
00:38:42,480 --> 00:38:43,680
What did you wish for?

936
00:38:45,800 --> 00:38:46,880
I was thinking of

937
00:38:47,190 --> 00:38:48,590
a friend from childhood.

938
00:38:49,510 --> 00:38:50,460
I'd really like to spend

939
00:38:50,460 --> 00:38:51,920
a birthday with her again.

940
00:38:55,000 --> 00:38:56,670
My wish has already come true.

941
00:38:58,670 --> 00:38:59,360
Flatterer.

942
00:39:00,880 --> 00:39:02,030
What did you wish for?

943
00:39:02,030 --> 00:39:03,210
I wished for

944
00:39:04,110 --> 00:39:06,520
In my prime's sales

945
00:39:06,550 --> 00:39:08,350
to exceed 100 million this year.

946
00:39:09,800 --> 00:39:11,260
That's an ambitious goal.

947
00:39:11,590 --> 00:39:12,630
Without a goal,

948
00:39:12,960 --> 00:39:13,960
how could I get you to willingly

949
00:39:13,960 --> 00:39:14,710
work for me?

950
00:39:15,190 --> 00:39:15,510
All right.

951
00:39:15,510 --> 00:39:17,070
Then the first piece of cake goes to you.

952
00:39:17,070 --> 00:39:18,670
May your wish come true soon.

953
00:39:19,280 --> 00:39:20,920
The first piece goes to Mom.

954
00:39:21,590 --> 00:39:23,390
Without her, I wouldn't be here.

955
00:39:23,400 --> 00:39:24,510
You silly girl.

956
00:39:25,510 --> 00:39:27,770
A year older, and your words are sweeter.

957
00:39:28,400 --> 00:39:29,560
Then my first piece

958
00:39:29,590 --> 00:39:30,390
goes to my dad.

959
00:39:31,510 --> 00:39:34,150
Thanks, Dad, for supporting me when I quit

960
00:39:34,760 --> 00:39:36,490
to start a business with Qi Shi.

961
00:39:38,000 --> 00:39:38,760
Okay, okay.

962
00:39:38,880 --> 00:39:39,610
Give it to me.

963
00:39:41,150 --> 00:39:41,770
Well,

964
00:39:42,190 --> 00:39:43,190
you two work hard.

965
00:39:43,670 --> 00:39:45,470
I'll wait to enjoy the good life.

966
00:39:48,150 --> 00:39:49,970
So, I'm at the bottom

967
00:39:50,000 --> 00:39:51,400
of the food chain, huh?

968
00:39:52,800 --> 00:39:53,950
It's fine. I'll do it myself.

969
00:39:53,950 --> 00:39:54,760
I'll do it myself.

970
00:39:54,760 --> 00:39:55,870
Self-sufficient.

971
00:39:58,440 --> 00:39:59,800
Get your dad a spoon.

972
00:40:00,190 --> 00:40:01,250
-Here, Dad.
-Okay.

973
00:40:04,510 --> 00:40:05,110
Is it good?

974
00:40:05,590 --> 00:40:06,790
It's good. Very good.

975
00:40:08,550 --> 00:40:09,080
Sweetie,

976
00:40:09,880 --> 00:40:11,290
you're a year older now.

977
00:40:12,550 --> 00:40:15,070
Dad has something to say to you.

978
00:40:16,760 --> 00:40:17,360
Don't just

979
00:40:18,480 --> 00:40:20,610
think about making money all the time.

980
00:40:22,000 --> 00:40:23,040
You also need to

981
00:40:23,070 --> 00:40:25,670
give your personal life
some serious thought.

982
00:40:25,840 --> 00:40:26,700
How about this?

983
00:40:27,000 --> 00:40:27,710
Let your mom

984
00:40:28,760 --> 00:40:30,020
help you find someone.

985
00:40:31,750 --> 00:40:32,750
The men your mom introduces

986
00:40:32,750 --> 00:40:33,420
have already been screened

987
00:40:33,420 --> 00:40:35,130
by the matchmaker,

988
00:40:35,550 --> 00:40:36,080
your mom,

989
00:40:36,510 --> 00:40:37,370
and your dad.

990
00:40:38,070 --> 00:40:39,000
They've been through three layers

991
00:40:39,000 --> 00:40:40,000
of screening.

992
00:40:40,150 --> 00:40:41,150
They can't be bad.

993
00:40:41,710 --> 00:40:42,110
Right.

994
00:40:42,640 --> 00:40:44,230
Men should marry and women should wed
when they come of age.

995
00:40:44,230 --> 00:40:45,290
The old saying

996
00:40:45,320 --> 00:40:46,520
puts it very clearly.

997
00:40:46,710 --> 00:40:47,710
I've already got

998
00:40:47,710 --> 00:40:49,170
a few candidates lined up.

999
00:40:49,190 --> 00:40:49,920
Just tell me

1000
00:40:49,920 --> 00:40:50,920
when you're free,

1001
00:40:51,000 --> 00:40:52,660
and I'll make an arrangement.

1002
00:40:53,030 --> 00:40:54,760
Meet them first. It can't hurt.

1003
00:40:55,320 --> 00:40:57,050
Right. Just listen to your mom.

1004
00:41:00,320 --> 00:41:01,850
Why is everyone rushing me?

1005
00:41:02,400 --> 00:41:03,670
There's another living,
breathing person right there.

1006
00:41:03,670 --> 00:41:05,070
Why is no one rushing him?

1007
00:41:05,190 --> 00:41:06,250
We're the same age.

1008
00:41:07,900 --> 00:41:08,550
Cao Xin,

1009
00:41:09,550 --> 00:41:11,110
what kind of girls do you like?

1010
00:41:11,110 --> 00:41:12,570
I can find someone for you.

1011
00:41:19,030 --> 00:41:20,430
Why are you looking at me?

1012
00:41:21,000 --> 00:41:21,860
On this matter,

1013
00:41:21,960 --> 00:41:23,770
I'm on the same side

1014
00:41:23,800 --> 00:41:25,130
as Mrs. Huo and Uncle Qi.

1015
00:41:25,760 --> 00:41:27,320
Si got married a long time ago.

1016
00:41:27,320 --> 00:41:28,760
She married young and already has a child.

1017
00:41:28,760 --> 00:41:29,420
Look at you.

1018
00:41:29,550 --> 00:41:30,810
Nothing's happening.

1019
00:41:32,800 --> 00:41:34,060
Why didn't Cao Si come?

1020
00:41:34,800 --> 00:41:35,330
Exactly.

1021
00:41:36,460 --> 00:41:37,760
Where is that brat Qi Zhi?

1022
00:41:37,760 --> 00:41:39,000
He didn't even come to his own sister's

1023
00:41:39,000 --> 00:41:39,630
birthday?

1024
00:41:40,840 --> 00:41:41,640
-Busy.
-Busy.

1025
00:41:42,510 --> 00:41:44,150
They went off to
take care of something else.

1026
00:41:44,150 --> 00:41:44,950
Right, right.

1027
00:41:44,960 --> 00:41:46,560
Kids are all busy these days.

1028
00:41:50,190 --> 00:41:51,120
Have some water.

1029
00:41:51,960 --> 00:41:52,510
I'll have it later.

1030
00:41:52,510 --> 00:41:53,510
Just leave it there.

1031
00:41:53,510 --> 00:41:53,970
Thanks.

1032
00:41:55,030 --> 00:41:55,840
Thanks.

1033
00:42:01,550 --> 00:42:02,400
Weird.

1034
00:42:04,320 --> 00:42:05,550
Yeah. So weird.

1035
00:42:06,920 --> 00:42:08,450
They're never this polite.

1036
00:42:13,000 --> 00:42:14,030
My brother

1037
00:42:14,030 --> 00:42:15,690
finally worked up the courage

1038
00:42:16,070 --> 00:42:17,320
to see Si yesterday,

1039
00:42:18,030 --> 00:42:19,290
but nothing happened?

1040
00:42:23,550 --> 00:42:24,970
Did Zhi say anything

1041
00:42:25,000 --> 00:42:26,530
when he got home yesterday?

1042
00:42:28,630 --> 00:42:29,430
What about Si?

1043
00:42:30,670 --> 00:42:32,470
She didn't say anything either.

1044
00:42:40,070 --> 00:42:40,760
Do you think

1045
00:42:41,760 --> 00:42:43,550
that after all these years,

1046
00:42:45,030 --> 00:42:46,150
Si just isn't

1047
00:42:46,150 --> 00:42:47,680
interested in Zhi anymore?

1048
00:42:48,230 --> 00:42:50,360
Let's stop trying to play matchmaker.

1049
00:42:51,030 --> 00:42:51,840
No way.

1050
00:42:53,150 --> 00:42:54,170
Childhood sweethearts

1051
00:42:54,170 --> 00:42:55,320
have the strongest bond

1052
00:42:55,320 --> 00:42:56,480
in the world.

1053
00:42:59,590 --> 00:43:01,190
I'm saying, I know my sister.

1054
00:43:01,490 --> 00:43:02,850
Qi Zhi definitely holds

1055
00:43:02,880 --> 00:43:03,650
a special place

1056
00:43:03,650 --> 00:43:04,300
in her heart.
